      <title>Flow Matching</title>
      <link href="/2026/11/12/Flow-Matching/"/>
      <url>/2026/11/12/Flow-Matching/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="什么是-Flow-Matching？"><a href="#什么是-Flow-Matching？" class="headerlink" title="什么是 Flow Matching？"></a>什么是 Flow Matching？</h2><ul><li>这是一个生成式模型，可以看作一种特殊的扩散模型。</li><li>对于 source → target 的映射，中间采样 N 步，利用神经网络预测其速度场。<ul><li>速度场可以理解为类似斜率的东西，是一个“随位置和时间变化的箭头场”。</li><li>在一个多维空间里，给定初始位置和速度场，那么轨迹是确定的。</li></ul></li><li>训练时，就是用神经网络来学习一个速度场。</li><li>推理时，从 source 出发，沿速度场走到 target。</li></ul><h2 id="训练损失"><a href="#训练损失" class="headerlink" title="训练损失"></a>训练损失</h2><ul><li>训练时存在的问题是，真实的向量场我们并不知道。</li><li>所以人工设计了一个条件向量场，一般在每个样本起点和终点之间画了一条“直线”。 $x_t &#x3D; (1 - t)x_0 + tx_1$ 这是线性插值出来的一条轨迹，保证了 $t_0$ 时刻在起点，1 时刻在终点。</li><li>时间间隔采样均匀的话，那么每一时刻这条路径上的速度是固定的。 $\frac{dx_t}{d_t} &#x3D; x_1 - x_0$</li><li>用样本点随机时刻的速度与模型的速度做一个 MSE 损失，用于训练模型。</li></ul><h2 id="模型特点"><a href="#模型特点" class="headerlink" title="模型特点"></a>模型特点</h2><ul><li>Flow Matching 的核心优点，是用一种更直接、更高效的方式，解决了传统扩散模型“生成慢、训练复杂”的缺点。</li><li>由于模型存在平均化特点，那么生成质量必然存在妥协。</li></ul><h2 id="代码示例"><a href="#代码示例" class="headerlink" title="代码示例"></a>代码示例</h2><p>该代码学习一种映射，将一组正态分布的二维点分成了两簇。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br><span class="line">102</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> os</span><br><span class="line">os.environ[<span class="string">&quot;KMP_DUPLICATE_LIB_OK&quot;</span>] = <span class="string">&quot;TRUE&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> torch</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> torch.nn <span class="keyword">as</span> nn</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> matplotlib.pyplot <span class="keyword">as</span> plt</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> numpy <span class="keyword">as</span> np</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ================= 1. 网络和采样（不变） =================</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">sample_target</span>(<span class="params">batch_size</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    x1 = torch.randn(batch_size // <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">2</span>) * <span class="number">0.5</span> + torch.tensor([<span class="number">2.0</span>, <span class="number">2.0</span>])</span><br><span class="line">    x2 = torch.randn(batch_size // <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">2</span>) * <span class="number">0.5</span> + torch.tensor([-<span class="number">2.0</span>, -<span class="number">2.0</span>])</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> torch.cat([x1, x2], dim=<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">sample_source</span>(<span class="params">batch_size</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> torch.randn(batch_size, <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">VelocityNet</span>(nn.Module):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">__init__</span>(<span class="params">self</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">super</span>().__init__()</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable language_">self</span>.net = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(<span class="number">3</span>, <span class="number">128</span>), nn.SiLU(), nn.Linear(<span class="number">128</span>, <span class="number">128</span>), nn.SiLU(), nn.Linear(<span class="number">128</span>, <span class="number">2</span>))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">forward</span>(<span class="params">self, x, t</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        t = t.view(-<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="variable language_">self</span>.net(torch.cat([x, t], dim=<span class="number">1</span>))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">model = VelocityNet()</span><br><span class="line">optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=<span class="number">1e-3</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;训练中...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> step <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">3000</span>):  <span class="comment"># 3000步足够看效果了</span></span><br><span class="line">    x0, x1 = sample_source(<span class="number">256</span>), sample_target(<span class="number">256</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    t = torch.rand(<span class="number">256</span>, <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    xt = (<span class="number">1</span> - t) * x0 + t * x1</span><br><span class="line">    loss = torch.mean((model(xt, t.squeeze()) - (x1 - x0)) ** <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    optimizer.zero_grad()</span><br><span class="line">    loss.backward()</span><br><span class="line">    optimizer.step()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> step % <span class="number">1000</span> == <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;Step <span class="subst">&#123;step&#125;</span>, Loss: <span class="subst">&#123;loss.item():<span class="number">.4</span>f&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ================= 2. 推理：不仅要生成，还要记录轨迹 =================</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@torch.no_grad()</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">generate_with_trajectory</span>(<span class="params">num_samples=<span class="number">200</span>, steps=<span class="number">30</span></span>):</span><br><span class="line">    x = sample_source(num_samples)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 【核心修改点 1】：根据初始的 x 坐标，给每个点分配一个颜色（从蓝到红）</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 这样我们就能追踪：原本在左边的（蓝色）去了哪？原本在右边的（红色）去了哪？</span></span><br><span class="line">    colors = x[:, <span class="number">0</span>].numpy()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    trajectory = [x.numpy().copy()]  <span class="comment"># 记录第 0 步的位置</span></span><br><span class="line">    dt = <span class="number">1.0</span> / steps</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(steps):</span><br><span class="line">        t_current = torch.ones(num_samples) * (i * dt)</span><br><span class="line">        v = model(x, t_current)</span><br><span class="line">        x = x + v * dt</span><br><span class="line">        trajectory.append(x.numpy().copy())  <span class="comment"># 记录每一步的位置</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> np.array(trajectory), colors</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ================= 3. 可视化绘图 =================</span></span><br><span class="line">trajectory, colors = generate_with_trajectory(num_samples=<span class="number">200</span>, steps=<span class="number">30</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">plt.figure(figsize=(<span class="number">18</span>, <span class="number">5</span>))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 图1：起点（杂乱无章的噪声，但我们按照初始的左右位置染了色）</span></span><br><span class="line">plt.subplot(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">3</span>, <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.scatter(trajectory[<span class="number">0</span>][:, <span class="number">0</span>], trajectory[<span class="number">0</span>][:, <span class="number">1</span>], c=colors, cmap=<span class="string">&#x27;coolwarm&#x27;</span>, alpha=<span class="number">0.8</span>, s=<span class="number">20</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.title(<span class="string">&quot;t=0 (Source Noise, colored by initial X)&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.xlim(-<span class="number">4</span>, <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.ylim(-<span class="number">4</span>, <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.grid(<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 图2：移动的轨迹（水流的方向）</span></span><br><span class="line">plt.subplot(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">3</span>, <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 选 20 个点画出它们的运动路线</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">20</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    plt.plot(trajectory[:, i, <span class="number">0</span>], trajectory[:, i, <span class="number">1</span>], alpha=<span class="number">0.5</span>, c=<span class="string">&#x27;gray&#x27;</span>, linewidth=<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 叠加起点和终点的散点</span></span><br><span class="line">plt.scatter(trajectory[<span class="number">0</span>][:, <span class="number">0</span>], trajectory[<span class="number">0</span>][:, <span class="number">1</span>], c=colors, cmap=<span class="string">&#x27;coolwarm&#x27;</span>, alpha=<span class="number">0.3</span>, s=<span class="number">10</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.scatter(trajectory[-<span class="number">1</span>][:, <span class="number">0</span>], trajectory[-<span class="number">1</span>][:, <span class="number">1</span>], c=colors, cmap=<span class="string">&#x27;coolwarm&#x27;</span>, alpha=<span class="number">0.8</span>, s=<span class="number">20</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.title(<span class="string">&quot;Flow Trajectories (How they move)&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.xlim(-<span class="number">4</span>, <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.ylim(-<span class="number">4</span>, <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.grid(<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 图3：终点（t=1 的生成结果，颜色保留了起点的印记）</span></span><br><span class="line">plt.subplot(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">3</span>, <span class="number">3</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.scatter(trajectory[-<span class="number">1</span>][:, <span class="number">0</span>], trajectory[-<span class="number">1</span>][:, <span class="number">1</span>], c=colors, cmap=<span class="string">&#x27;coolwarm&#x27;</span>, alpha=<span class="number">0.8</span>, s=<span class="number">20</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.title(<span class="string">&quot;t=1 (Generated Data, color preserved)&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.xlim(-<span class="number">4</span>, <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.ylim(-<span class="number">4</span>, <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">plt.grid(<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">plt.show()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/Figure_1.png" alt="图一：训练结果"></p><h2 id="自动驾驶中的应用"><a href="#自动驾驶中的应用" class="headerlink" title="自动驾驶中的应用"></a>自动驾驶中的应用</h2><ul><li>Motus 里面视频专家：在给定首帧、语言指令和 VLM 特征的情况下，在 Wan VAE 的 latent 空间里从纯噪声出发，10 步 Euler 积分出 8 帧未来画面（384×320）。</li><li>Motus 里面动作专家：动作不再用回归头直接输出，而是同样从噪声生成 <code>[B, action_chunk_size, 14]</code> 的动作 chunk。</li></ul><hr><blockquote><p>本文仅作为个人学习记录，如有不正确地方，欢迎指正。</p></blockquote><p><strong>本文参考以下资料：</strong></p><ol><li>直观理解 Flow Matching 算法（带源码） - 张云聪的文章 - 知乎<br><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/28731517852">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/28731517852</a></li><li><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_33158887/article/details/166661633">https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_33158887/article/details/166661633</a></li></ol>]]></content>
      
      
      
